      "reasons": [
        "The definition’s general statement that “Affect intensity is the strength or degree of an emotion as it is experienced” is not explicitly stated in the provided packet; the packet only names a specific endpoint (“negative affect intensity”) and describes it as an outcome assessed by EMA.",
